{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024065533461-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024094436\"/><p>另一隻貓咪。(陳俊華攝)</p><p>今晨(24日)6時30分，屯門顯發邨顯發樓高層單位，有一隻貓懷疑爬出窗外，被困大廈外牆位置。救援人員接報到場，惟單位沒有人，消防破門入屋拯救，成功將貓咪救回。牠沒有受傷，惟屋內仍有3隻貓咪，由於未能聯絡戶主，愛協人員將4隻貓咪帶走，包括3隻英國短貓及1隻德文貓，並繼續聯絡戶主。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:03:58.829091+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T22:55:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:58:16.296226+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:58:27.855385+00:00","content_hash":"acc750e4a322ba4d66c94e2c49d32fce345dd80652dec12caf0dd12a7effa32b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:03:58.829091+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}